# Image-processing dev scripts (not part of the app). Anchored to this
# directory only (leading slash, no recursive wildcard) so it catches the
# throwaway scripts sitting at this level without also hiding real tooling
# one directory down, e.g. scripts/ -- found 2026-09-28 when this blanket
# *.cjs silently blocked scripts/defer-main-css.cjs from ever being added.
/*.cjs
